# SQLite database. Deliberately NOT tracked: the live database on the server
# holds real customer orders, and a deploy does `git pull`, which would
# overwrite or delete a tracked copy. The catalogue is rebuilt on deploy by
# scripts/migrate-catalog.js from database/catalog.json, which IS tracked.
database/*.db
database/*.db-shm
database/*.db-wal
database/backups/

